{"availability":"available","full":"kangjul3854/hyufa","name":"hyufa","description":"HYUFA is an AI finance assistant for university students and young professionals — from basic financial knowledge to personalized portfolio guidance. HYUFA는 간단한 금융 상식부터 포트폴리오 추천까지, 대학생과 사회초년생을 위한 AI 금융 상담 서비스입니다. ","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":244,"forks":4,"created":"2025-11-19T13:49:07Z","updated":"2025-12-07T01:42:07Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["ai","budgeting","chatbot","economics","finance","financial-literacy","fintech","generative-ai","html","javascript","korean","krwg","open-source-project","open-source-projects","personal-finance","student-project","students","university","webapp"],"demo":"https://kangjul3854.github.io/hyufa/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.304Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.304Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.304Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:06:47.082Z","stars":245,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:00.386Z","stars":245,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:03:49.920Z","stars":245,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:34:18.153Z","stars":245,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.304Z","stars":244,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["💣 KRW is falling. If you don't learn finance now, when will you? 대학생을 위한 AI 금융 멘토 챗봇. A student-friendly AI financial mentor.","💸 HYUFA — AI Personal Finance Mentor for Students “떨어지는 원화 가치에 재테크의 필요성을 느끼는 사람들을 위해.” HYUFA는 대학생과 사회초년생을 위한 AI 기반 금융 멘토링 웹앱입니다. 지출 습관과 목표만 입력하면, 맞춤 예산·포트폴리오·금융 해설을 제공합니다. 현재는 화폐가치 폭락 1위인 한국어만 제공하고 있지만 향후 더 많은 언어로 챗봇을 제공할 수 있습니다.","\"For students who panic at their bank balance every month.\" HYUFA is an AI-powered finance mentor web app designed for university students and young professionals. Enter your spending habits and goals — get personalized budgets, portfolio advice, and financial insights."],"features":["✔ 재테크는 하고 싶은데, 어디서 시작해야 할지 모르고","✔ Want to invest but don’t know where to start","✔ Find financial terms confusing","✔ Stop using complex finance apps","✔ Wish someone could explain things simply"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kangjul3854/hyufa/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0b7b5ac0cab8db4916bfd4c87fb272701cc8c809f8ea12f72f4d289eab3cb178","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:06:47.180Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.404Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"💣 KRW is falling. If you don't learn finance now, when will you? 대학생을 위한 AI 금융 멘토 챗봇. A student-friendly AI financial mentor.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kangjul3854/hyufa/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"\"For students who panic at their bank balance every month.\" HYUFA is an AI-powered finance mentor web app designed for university students and young professionals. Enter your spending habits and goals — get personalized budgets, portfolio advice, and financial insights.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kangjul3854/hyufa/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0b7b5ac0cab8db4916bfd4c87fb272701cc8c809f8ea12f72f4d289eab3cb178","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kangjul3854/hyufa/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.405Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-12-07T01:42:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kangjul3854/hyufa/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.405Z","hash":"0b7b5ac0cab8db4916bfd4c87fb272701cc8c809f8ea12f72f4d289eab3cb178","originalBytes":4471,"storedBytes":4471,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:05.304Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://kangjul3854.github.io/hyufa/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T09:33:44.627Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"unknown","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":9,"error":{"reason":"empty_page","at":"2026-10-18T09:33:44.627Z"},"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-21T09:33:44.627Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T09:33:44.627Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://kangjul3854.github.io/hyufa/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T09: